      "title": "Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis: Shengmai San for Anthracycline Cardiotoxicity (2022)",
      "description": "This meta-analysis evaluated Shengmai San preparations for protecting against heart damage caused by anthracycline chemotherapy drugs. Results suggested beneficial effects on reducing arrhythmias and markers of cardiac injury, though study quality was generally low. The authors called for better-designed confirmatory trials.",
